      <marc:subfield code="a">Well-known woodsman, Ben Law, demonstrates 15 practical projects, shaped by hand and infused with simple rustic beauty. Many of the items are hewn from green wood and include fencing, hurdles, walking sticks, spoons, chairs, a basket and a broom. There are sections on crafts for the farm, garden, and the home, wood fuel, plus handy directories of tree species, tools and devices.</marc:subfield>
